      "a": "The federal government awarded $6.4B through SDVOSB set-asides in FY2026 to date. That total comes from 12,852 awards with an average award size of $502K. Obligations are down 25.8% year over year, and FY2026 to date sits below recent fiscal-year totals such as $8.7B in FY25 and $8.8B in FY24."
